node_modules/
dist/
dist-single/
# Captured frames are large and regenerable, so they stay out. The verdicts are
# the record of what each round actually found, and a critic loop whose findings
# live only on one machine's disk cannot be compared across rounds — so those
# stay in. Git will not descend into an excluded directory, hence the layered
# re-inclusion rather than a plain `shots/`.
shots/*
!shots/critique/
shots/critique/*
!shots/critique/*/
shots/critique/*/*
!shots/critique/*/VERDICT.md
*.log
.DS_Store
